>
<Nav /><section class="section hero orange__03"><div class="container__01"><div class="hero-wrapper align-top"><div class="hero-content margin-top"><h1 class="h1-heading">Delivering Results for Referred Cases</h1><p class="paragraph__19 margin-64 hero">At TBW Law, we are dedicated to providing exceptional legal representation for our clients, and we have built a strong reputation for achieving outstanding outcomes, especially in cases that have been referred to us by other attorneys and firms. <br><br></p><a href="/contact-us" class="button main is--orange w-inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>Referral Form</div><div class="button__arrow is--new w-embed"><svg width="23" height="21" viewBox="0 0 23 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M12.9123 1.72409L21.5003 10.6489M21.5003 10.6489L12.9123 19.649M21.5003 10.6489L1.00006 10.6489" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></div></div></a></div><div class="hero-image-wrapper hero-image-45 margin-mb"><img src="/images/team_win1.png" loading="lazy" width="559" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 41vw" alt="" srcset="/images/team_win1-p-500.png 500w, /images/team_win1-p-800.png 800w, /images/team_win1.png 896w" class="hero-image hero-full-width"></div></div></div></section><div class="section problems"><div class="container__01"><div class="center-wrapper"><h2 class="h2-heading center wider fad"><strong>Collaborative Success, Maximum Recovery</strong>.</h2><p class="paragraph center fade-up">Our team of seasoned trial lawyers has the skills, resources, and determination to maximize recoveries for clients, whether we are handling a case from the start or partnering with referring counsel.</p></div><div class="problmes-wrapper"><div class="problmens-image-wrapper fade-in-up"><img src="/images/referrals_2.png" loading="lazy" width="600" height="500" alt="" srcset="/images/referrals_2-p-500.png 500w, /images/referrals_2.png 720w" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 24vw, (max-width: 991px) 27vw, 28vw" class="section-image radius problem"><div class="absolute-image-wrapper _03"></div></div><div class="problems-content"><div id="w-node-_5d8c6ae8-c367-c04c-c058-7da9114ae2b2-489a28c2" class="benefits-item fade-in-up"><div class="benefits-item__title">Trusted within the Industry</div><p>Our firm's unwavering commitment to legal excellence, ethical practices, and substantial client recoveries has earned us widespread respect among peers.</p></div><div id="w-node-_5d8c6ae8-c367-c04c-c058-7da9114ae2b7-489a28c2" class="benefits-item fade-in-up"><div class="benefits-item__title">Maximizing Recovery </div><p>Our strategic approach and deep legal expertise ensure we pursue every possible avenue to secure the highest possible compensation for referred clients.</p></div><div id="w-node-_5d8c6ae8-c367-c04c-c058-7da9114ae2bc-489a28c2" class="benefits-item fade-in-up"><div class="benefits-item__title">Fair and Transparent</div><p>Integrity drives our practice. We provide clear, upfront communication about case potential, fees, and expected outcomes to all referring attorneys.</p></div><div id="w-node-_5d8c6ae8-c367-c04c-c058-7da9114ae2c1-489a28c2" class="benefits-item fade-in-up"><div class="benefits-item__title">Focused and Results Driven</div><p>We meticulously analyze every detail, strategically building compelling cases that cut through complexity and consistently deliver meaningful, impactful legal outcomes.</p></div></div></div></div></div><section class="section content-02 orange"><div class="container__01"><div class="flexbox-wrapper _02 c-left"><div class="content-wrapper width-42"><h2 class="h2-heading margin-15">Proven Results for Referred Cases</h2><p class="paragraph margin-40">When you refer a case to TBW Law, you can be confident that your clients are in the best possible hands. Our attorneys have a long-standing track record of securing impressive verdicts and settlements, especially in complex or high-stakes cases that have been referred to us. <br><br>We take pride in our ability to collaborate seamlessly with referring lawyers, preserving their involvement while maximizing the recoveries for their clients.</p></div><div class="image-wrapper auto-height"><img src="/images/happy_referral.png" loading="lazy" width="602" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 42vw" alt="" srcset="/images/happy_referral-p-500.png 500w, /images/happy_referral-p-800.png 800w, /images/happy_referral-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/happy_referral.png 1231w" class="section-image"></div></div><div class="stats-wrapper"><div class="stats-item fade-in-up"><div class="stats-item__number">5.2 million</div><div class="stats-item__line"></div><p class="paragraph gray">Awarded to a personal injury firm after referring a complex truck accident case involving a defective vehicle component.</p></div><div class="stats-item fade-in-up"><div class="stats-item__number">4.7 million</div><div class="stats-item__line"></div><p class="paragraph gray">Paid for a wrongful death claim referred by our firm, stemming from a motorcycle accident involving a commercial vehicle.</p></div><div class="stats-item fade-in-up"><div class="stats-item__number">3.8 million</div><div class="stats-item__line"></div><p class="paragraph gray">Secured for an amputation case referred by a personal injury firm, stemming from a motorcycle accident involving a commercial vehicle.</p></div></div></div><div class="bottom-wrapper margin-100"><div class="paragraph__22">There's a reason why firms collaborate with TBW</div><a href="/get-started" class="button main is--orange w-inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>Refer a Case</div><div class="button__arrow is--new w-embed"><svg width="23" height="21" viewBox="0 0 23 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M12.9123 1.72409L21.5003 10.6489M21.5003 10.6489L12.9123 19.649M21.5003 10.6489L1.00006 10.6489" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></div></div></a></div></section><div class="section testimonals__02 hidden"><div class="container__01"><div class="center-wrapper"><h2 class="h2-heading fade-up">Real-world success stories</h2><div class="testimonials-collection w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="testimonial-wrapper__02 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="testimonials-item fade-in-up w-dyn-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Referring cases to TBW always results in outstanding verdicts and client satisfaction.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper__02"><div class="testimonials-image-wrapper-02"><img alt="" src="" loading="lazy" class="testimonials-image w-dyn-bind-empty"></div><div class="slider-person__name">Robert S.</div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="testimonials-item fade-in-up w-dyn-item"><p class="paragraph slider">TBW’s litigation expertise helped us achieve a remarkable settlement for our client.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper__02"><div class="testimonials-image-wrapper-02"><img alt="" src="" loading="lazy" class="testimonials-image w-dyn-bind-empty"></div><div class="slider-person__name">Mark K.</div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="testimonials-item fade-in-up w-dyn-item"><p class="paragraph slider">When a case won’t settle, we always turn to TBW for trial success.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper__02"><div class="testimonials-image-wrapper-02"><img alt="" src="" loading="lazy" class="testimonials-image w-dyn-bind-empty"></div><div class="slider-person__name">James H.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><section class="section slider"><div class="container__01"><div class="center-wrapper"><h2 class="h2-heading margin-25 fade-up">Real-client success stories</h2><p class="paragraph center has--margin-40">Positive experiences shared by clients, partners and our community.</p><a href="/success-stories--2" class="button main is--orange w-inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>Read All Success Stories</div><div class="button__arrow is--new w-embed"><svg width="23" height="21" viewBox="0 0 23 21" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M12.9123 1.72409L21.5003 10.6489M21.5003 10.6489L12.9123 19.649M21.5003 10.6489L1.00006 10.6489" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></div></div></a></div><div class="is--slider-whole"><div class="slider-arrow-wrapper fade-up"><div class="slider-arrows"><a id="left-button" fs-mirrorclick-element="trigger" href="#" class="arrow-circle-link left w-inline-block swiper-button-disabled"><div class="arrow-circle left"><img src="/images/Line-45.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="arrow-icon-left"></div></a><a id="right-button" fs-mirrorclick-element="trigger-2" href="#" class="arrow-circle-link w-inline-block"><div class="arrow-circle"><img src="/images/Line-45.svg" loading="lazy" width="20" alt="" class="arrow-icon-right"></div></a></div></div><div id="basic-swiper" class="testimonials-slider-collection is--success-stories w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="collection-list-8 swiper-wrapper is-succes--stories-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Ted was extremely professional, personable and knows the law well. I hired Ted 2 years ago, and he handled my Personal Injury matter. I had previously worked with 4 lawyers. We went to trial and the defense attorney for Wholefoods had met his match. If you need representation I highly recommend Ted!</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Dr. Tom Bakman</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Words simply cannot express how much I appreciate all of your efforts on my behalf before and during trial. Your gentlemanly professionalism was obvious to everyone in that courtroom. I am so pleased that your schedule allowed you to work on my case—and do such a splendid job!</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-female-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Patricia Heckhaus</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">I have known Ted for over 25 years and he has always been a hard-working and dedicated individual that I respect. Ted represented me in two cases and won both.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Tom</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">I am really thankful for the effort…I will never forget your dedication towards this case. You always wanted to make sure I get the best from this. Thank you so much! I just told my parents…they are thanking you so much for the work you have done for our family!</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Karteek Koganti</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">My experience in this office was very pleasant, very good service, very attentive and friendly staff.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-female-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Gabriella Juarez</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Best lawyer I could ask for when it came to my car accident. Really fought to get to us what we needed and took care of our case.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-female-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">Brittney Vigil</div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-2 swiper-slide is-success-stories-slide w-dyn-item"><div class="slider-item"><p class="paragraph slider">Best lawyer you could need. Got my case settled in 6 months. I was able to be at home and recover and he took care of it.</p><div class="slider-person-wrapper"><img alt="" src="/images/icn-male-1.png" loading="lazy" class="slider-item__avatar"><div class="slider-person__name">John Vigil</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section resources padding-small"><div class="seperator-wrapper top"><div class="seperator-line"></div></div><div class="container__01"><div class="center-wrapper-tablet"><div class="heading-button-wrapper"><h2 class="h2-heading no-margin fade-up">Personal Injury Articles and Related</h2><a href="https://tbwlawfirm.webflow.io/blog?category=Recent+News" class="button white hide-tablet fade-up w-inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>View all news »</div></div></a></div><div class="resourses-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="resourses-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="resourses-list-item fade-in-up w-dyn-item"><a href="/blog/ted-wacker-will-moderator-the-caoie-caoc-octla-palm-springs-seminar" class="blog-image-link w-inline-block"><img src="/images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb.png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 27vw" srcset="/images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb-p-500.png 500w, /images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb-p-800.png 800w, /images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/69e7f221-PS_seminar_tb.png 1630w" class="cms-image"></a><div class="category-list w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="collection-list-4 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="blog-category margin">Events &amp; Sponsorship</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="blog-category margin">Recent News</div></div></div></div><div class="cms-title">Ted Wacker will moderator the CAOIE CAOC OCTLA Palm Springs Seminar</div></div><div role="listitem" class="resourses-list-item fade-in-up w-dyn-item"><a href="/blog/motorcyclist-faces-life-altering-injuries-in-baker-v-doe-case" class="blog-image-link w-inline-block"><img src="/images/Baker_banner.png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 27vw" srcset="/images/Baker_banner-p-500.png 500w, /images/Baker_banner-p-800.png 800w, /images/Baker_banner.png 1300w" class="cms-image"></a><div class="category-list w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="collection-list-4 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="blog-category margin">Case News</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="blog-category margin">Recent News</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="blog-category margin">Videos</div></div></div></div><div class="cms-title">Motorcyclist Faces Life-Altering Injuries in Baker v. Doe Case</div></div><div role="listitem" class="resourses-list-item fade-in-up w-dyn-item"><a href="/blog/motorcyclist-wins-justice-in-condon-v-doe-after-devastating-crash" class="blog-image-link w-inline-block"><img src="/images/Condon_banner.png" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, (max-width: 991px) 80vw, 27vw" srcset="/images/Condon_banner-p-500.png 500w, /images/Condon_banner-p-800.png 800w, /images/Condon_banner.png 1300w" class="cms-image"></a><div class="category-list w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="collection-list-4 w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="blog-category margin">Case News</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="blog-category margin">Recent News</div></div></div></div><div class="cms-title">Motorcyclist Wins Justice in Condon v. Doe After Devastating Crash</div></div></div></div><a href="#" class="button white hide-desktop w-inline-block"><div class="button__wrapper"><div>View all resources »</div></div></a></div></div></section><Footer /><!-- Google Tag Manager (noscript) -->

